  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born from the toxic runoff beneath Subchain City, 'Controller' Quack's early life was spent scavenging for scraps and dodging territorial goose gangs. He honed his skills playing old-world console simulators found in the ruins, mastering strategies that would prove invaluable in the DRIP wars.",
    "class": "Tactician",
